// Recipe content (ARCHITECTURE.md §3.6) — data, never hardcoded in sim_core.
//
// `schema_version` follows ARCHITECTURE.md §4's data-file versioning rule:
// the loader must reject or migrate a mismatched version rather than
// silently misreading a changed shape.
//
// Milestone 3 (Core loop proof) deliberately ships a single, single-input
// recipe: the milestone's own scope is "one belt, one machine, one recipe."
// GAMEPLAY.md §2's real tomato-sauce tier also lists salt as an ingredient;
// a second raw input implies a second belt, which is milestone 4 (First
// full chain) scope, not this one — don't read this file as the final
// tomato sauce recipe.
(
    schema_version: 1,
    recipes: [
        Recipe(
            id: "tomato_sauce",
            inputs: [("tomato", 4)],
            outputs: [("tomato_sauce", 1)],
            machine: "cooker",
            time_ticks: 180,
        ),
    ],
)
